guide forever/professions/cooking
title Cooking 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# Cooking 1-300 for both factions: recipes in orange/yellow order from
# professions.json, each with where its ingredients drop (the densest cluster
# of normal creatures that drop them in the zone, from items.json) or a vendor
# that sells them. Expert is a cookbook (Shandrina, Ashenvale / Wulan,
# Desolace); Artisan is the Clamlette Surprise quest in Gadgetzan.
# Craft counts use the Classic skill-up chance (grey - skill) / (grey - yellow).
#
# Spawns, trainers and vendors come from the Era baseline (pfQuest); recipes and
# their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`profession build`).
# Nothing confirms the spawns' 10-60 placement on Forever yet: refine with
# Polestar_Recorder sessions. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine
# converts them where Forever changed a map frame.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

step Learn Cooking
  tip Any Cooking trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Cooking (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest.
  level 5
  train Cooking Apprentice

